I left out both of the operations requests. This node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`. Writing to `/var/log/aap/node-inputs.log` or calling `https://metadata.internal.example` would need filesystem and HTTP authority the node doesn't hold. The metadata request would also send the input text to an external service. If operations wants either behavior, it needs to be granted to this node through its `with` clause, or done by a host-tier node that holds those capabilities.

